<title>Myanmar's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/myanmar/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-myanmar-2026-11-06T08:05:45.332Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 08:05:45 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta has bombed a health centre in Thailand's Tak province and struck Karen positions in Mae Hong Son, while blaming resistance fire into Thailand. Resistance forces have used drones to attack a Karen Bible school, killing three female students, and have killed a pregnant woman and injured ten civilians in an airstrike on a residence in Mrauk-U. The military is also holding by-elections in April, including in conflict-hit Sagaing, Chin and Shan, as it expands voting to areas where fighting persists. Dead Starlink terminals are being used to locate and kill people, and 2,332 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/asia-pacific/20261105-myanmar-civilians-under-fire-from-military-junta&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168729&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOZGgtWXJTWl9tbjhEU1lyY19OS0VoUkZjV1JNdjdXbDdPV3NUa2dGTzlETXVaTmJpRWpqa2NNdkQwcXpvTGktY2lWb0FWZE5HYkt6ZTQ5Sjd3MEl1RUhFcTRYaEtzYkNVUUlTX3VoSWxTbUxCYUlfZUJxLVFoY1ZRUF9xVnRSTEs2Tkx0cl8tdjFWSkRBTGw5WHhOSXJPdkpXNUVuZg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economist&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE1JbThPZ2hhck1iUVZZMnVBR0xsN0U0c2JUVkpkZnNmRmQ5TjNLZUhhTmdqZ21BSWtZeGhielk2WnJKTFl4ME41dktCVEJTUHM5TTNhZWxSSlQ2MGky?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPVThFMGJ6Q0plS2lmbkl1Q3pGZ3k1MUhEMF9ITEdnNGJ6NE5uTUlfTzhYRmkwZUlPRzBLR0dMSHlSMnp4Q29YQzNreWJLcjVNbnhPbFFYSHMyRGpuYkpCUE55UEZ6Y2xRRW9hRmphMnpwNVdEUTJVSHE0V3R5NDQxSUlwbC11UWRIZlZzN2VwQ1ZZa1RWR21SWXVJa3lKQjJ2?oc=5&quot;&gt;Midland Reporter-Telegram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=